(7700538, 1263860, 97225, '<td valign="top">The flower provides a lovely point of interest but I can''t keep my eyes off those leaves. I love their tones, shapes and textures - and all those little puddles in their centres are fabulous. Top few.</td>', 'The flower provides a lovely point of interest but I can''t keep my eyes off those leaves. I love their tones, shapes and textures - and all those little puddles in their centres are fabulous. Top few.', '2021-09-06 00:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
