(7700546, 1263656, 173844, '<td valign="top">Incredible clouds, central rainstorm and a vast expanse with what appears to be a river running through it.  Maybe that doesn''t seem enough, but it does seem that the planet itself is talking to us.  Let''s listen.  The wild primaeval has something to say.  The heavy grain sets the mysterious mood of the image.  I could stare into this for a while.  Thanks for bringing it to us.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Incredible clouds, central rainstorm and a vast expanse with what appears to be a river running through it.  Maybe that doesn''t seem enough, but it does seem that the planet itself is talking to us.  Let''s listen.  The wild primaeval has something to say.  The heavy grain sets the mysterious mood of the image.  I could stare into this for a while.  Thanks for bringing it to us.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-09-06 00:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
