(7700556, 1263839, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific path through these intricate, delicate birches.  Only black and white, I believe, can convey this dynamic harmony of tones and foggy drift into a prevailing high key.  There''s a sense of magical immanence in the moment.  Beautiful image.</td>', 'Terrific path through these intricate, delicate birches.  Only black and white, I believe, can convey this dynamic harmony of tones and foggy drift into a prevailing high key.  There''s a sense of magical immanence in the moment.  Beautiful image.', '2021-09-06 00:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700557, 1263868, 173844, '<td valign="top">Great view from within the tunnel to the outer daylight.  How nicely the gleaming tracks draw us along.  The prevailing dimness of the inside then opens into a glimpse of intricate city life.  Fine use of black and white.</td>', 'Great view from within the tunnel to the outer daylight.  How nicely the gleaming tracks draw us along.  The prevailing dimness of the inside then opens into a glimpse of intricate city life.  Fine use of black and white.', '2021-09-06 00:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700558, 1263863, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice title, made so by the softness surrounding the bird.  And so the sharpness and contrast within the bird''s form is established.  The elegance of his or her pose lends to the languid mood.</td>', 'Nice title, made so by the softness surrounding the bird.  And so the sharpness and contrast within the bird''s form is established.  The elegance of his or her pose lends to the languid mood.', '2021-09-06 00:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700559, 1263859, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sensitive portrait featuring the child''s eyes, which appear to be, excuse me if not so, strongly enhanced.  I especially like how the face is not fussed up.  It imparts a winning naturalness.</td>', 'Sensitive portrait featuring the child''s eyes, which appear to be, excuse me if not so, strongly enhanced.  I especially like how the face is not fussed up.  It imparts a winning naturalness.', '2021-09-06 00:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700560, 1263648, 173844, '<td valign="top">Light and dark layers build upon themselves to create a dynamic sensibility.  I like the dark central forest sandwiched between the sunlit clouds and their reflection.  Fascinating mood.</td>', 'Light and dark layers build upon themselves to create a dynamic sensibility.  I like the dark central forest sandwiched between the sunlit clouds and their reflection.  Fascinating mood.', '2021-09-06 00:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
