(7700580, 1263858, 3306, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue! I had remembered the composite and loved it but didnt remember that it was yours.  Such expressive birds. I could watch them all day long! What a terrific capture:)</td>', 'Congrats on the blue! I had remembered the composite and loved it but didnt remember that it was yours.  Such expressive birds. I could watch them all day long! What a terrific capture:)', '2021-09-06 07:43:46.000000', NULL, 0),
